</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Autologous bone grafting: complications at the donor site</article-title><source>J Bone Joint Surg</source><year>1971</year><volume>53</volume><fpage>153</fpage></citation></ref><ref id="B7"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Keller</surname><given-names>EE</given-names></name><name><surname>Triplett</surname><given-names>WW</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Iliac bone grafting: review of 160 consecutive cases</article-title><source>J Oral Maxillofac Surg</source><year>1987</year><volume>45</volume><fpage>11</fpage><lpage>14</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">3540237</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/0278-2391(87)90079-6</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B8"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Sawin</surname><given-names>PD</given-names></name><name><surname>Traynelis</surname><given-names>VC</given-names></name><name><surname>Menezes</surname><given-names>AH</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>A comparative analysis of fusion rates and donor-site morbidity for autogeneic rib and iliac crest bone grafts in posterior cervical fusions</article-title><source>J Neurosurg</source><year>1998</year><volume>88</volume><fpage>255</fpage><lpage>265</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9452233</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Summers</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Eisenstein</surname><given-names>SM</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Donor site pain from the ilium. A complication of lumbar spine fusion</article-title><source>J Bone Joint Surg Br</source><year>1989</year><volume>71</volume><fpage>677</fpage><lpage>680</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">2768321</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-